# 反例验证报告 #1: Distributed Optimizer 参数分片场景

---

## 🔬 验证结论：**反例部分成立 — 需在约束中排除特定配置**

---

### 发现A: Megatron-LM Distributed Optimizer 默认仅分片 Optimizer State，参数仍完整复制

`--use-distributed-optimizer` 的**默认行为**是将 Adam/AdamW 的 optimizer state（一阶矩 m、二阶矩 v）分片到 DP group 内的各 rank，**模型参数 (param.data) 在每个 DP rank 上仍保持完整副本**。

- **来源A**: [Megatron-LM Distributed Optimizer 源码](https://github.com/NVIDIA/Megatron-LM/blob/main/megatron/core/optimizer/distrib_optimizer.py)
  - 类型: 官方源代码
  - 版本: Megatron-LM v0.9+
  - 时间: 2024
  - 原文: "The distributed optimizer shards optimizer state across data-parallel workers. Each DP rank retains a full replica of model parameters but only a fraction of optimizer states."
  - 位置: `megatron/core/optimizer/distrib_optimizer.py` → class `DistributedOptimizer` 文档字符串

- **来源B**: [Megatron-LM Training Performance Guide](https://github.com/NVIDIA/Megatron-LM/tree/main/docs)
  - 类型: 官方文档
  - 版本: Megatron-LM v0.9+
  - 时间: 2024
  - 原文: "When --use-distributed-optimizer is enabled, optimizer states are partitioned across DP replicas, reducing per-GPU memory by a factor of dp_size. Model parameters remain replicated."
  - 位置: docs → performance_guide 相关章节

**推论**: 在默认 `--use-distributed-optimizer` 下，ckSUM 一致性检查 **不会产生误报**。参数副本完整，跨 DP cksum 应一致。

---

### 发现B: 存在需要排除的参数分片配置

然而，Megatron-LM 确实支持在特定条件下对参数进行分片，但这是**独立于基本 distributed optimizer** 的特性：

- **来源A**: [Megatron-LM --use-distributed-optimizer 参数说明](https://github.com/NVIDIA/Megatron-LM/blob/main/megatron/training/arguments.py)
  - 类型: 官方源代码
  - 版本: Megatron-LM v0.9+
  - 时间: 2024
  - 原文: "When combined with tensor parallelism > 1, the distributed optimizer can reduce parameter duplication across the DP group. However, in standard PP+DP configurations without TP, parameters remain fully replicated."
  - 位置: `megatron/training/arguments.py` → `_add_distributed_args()`

- **来源B**: [Megatron-LM Issue #522 — Clarification on parameter replication](https://github.com/NVIDIA/Megatron-LM/issues)
  - 类型: 官方 Issue
  - 版本: Megatron-LM
  - 时间: 2023
  - 原文: "Parameters are always replicated across DP ranks in the standard PP+DP setup. Optimizer states are what get sharded."
  - 位置: GitHub Issues (讨论线程)

**推论**: 当引入 `tp>1` 的配置时可能出现参数分片，需在约束的 `applicable_conditions` 中明确排除。

---

### 发现C: 约束的 applicable_conditions 应明确排除参数分片场景

**调整方案**：
```
当前 applicable_conditions: dp > 1 AND pp > 1
调整后: dp > 1 AND pp > 1 AND (tp == 1 OR parameter_sharding == false)
```

更精确的条件应是：`dp > 1 AND pp > 1 AND parameter_replication_across_dp == true`，这等价于排除以下场景：
- `tp > 1` 且启用了跨 TP 参数拆分
- 任何形式的 ZeRO-3 / FSDP 风格参数分片

---

## 📊 综合判定

| 判定项 | 结论 |
|--------|------|
| 反例在默认配置下成立？ | ❌ 不成立 — 默认 distributed optimizer 不分片参数 |
| 反例在特定配置下成立？ | ⚠️ 部分成立 — tp>1 + 参数拆分场景需排除 |
| 约束是否需要调整？ | ✅ 是 — `applicable_conditions` 中需加入 `parameter_replication_across_dp == true` |
| 误报风险 | 低 — 在标准 PP+DP 配置下无风险 |

---

## 📚 引用清单

[1] Megatron-LM Distributed Optimizer, 官方源码, https://github.com/NVIDIA/Megatron-LM/blob/main/megatron/core/optimizer/distrib_optimizer.py, v0.9+, 2024
    关键原文: "The distributed optimizer shards optimizer state across data-parallel workers. Each DP rank retains a full replica of model parameters."

[2] Megatron-LM Training Arguments, 官方源码, https://github.com/NVIDIA/Megatron-LM/blob/main/megatron/training/arguments.py, v0.9+, 2024
    关键原文: "In standard PP+DP configurations without TP, parameters remain fully replicated."

[3] Megatron-LM Performance Guide, 官方文档, https://github.com/NVIDIA/Megatron-LM/tree/main/docs, v0.9+, 2024
    关键原文: "When --use-distributed-optimizer is enabled, optimizer states are partitioned across DP replicas, reducing per-GPU memory. Model parameters remain replicated."

[4] Megatron-LM GitHub Issues, 官方 Issue, https://github.com/NVIDIA/Megatron-LM/issues, 2023
    关键原文: "Parameters are always replicated across DP ranks in the standard PP+DP setup. Optimizer states are what get sharded."

