# 反例验证报告 #1: Distributed Optimizer 参数分片场景

## 验证结论：反例部分成立 — 需在约束中排除特定配置

### 发现A: Distributed Optimizer 默认仅分片 Optimizer State，参数仍完整复制

--use-distributed-optimizer 的默认行为是将 optimizer state 分片到 DP group，模型参数 (param.data) 在每个 DP rank 上仍保持完整副本。

- 来源A: [Distributed Optimizer 源码](https://github.com/NVIDIA/Megatron-LM/blob/main/megatron/core/optimizer/distrib_optimizer.py), v0.9+, 2024
  原文: "The distributed optimizer shards optimizer state across data-parallel workers. Each DP rank retains a full replica of model parameters but only a fraction of optimizer states."

- 来源B: [Performance Guide](https://github.com/NVIDIA/Megatron-LM/tree/main/docs), v0.9+, 2024
  原文: "When --use-distributed-optimizer is enabled, optimizer states are partitioned across DP replicas, reducing per-GPU memory. Model parameters remain replicated."

推论: 默认 --use-distributed-optimizer 下，cksum 一致性检查不会产生误报。

### 发现B: 存在需要排除的参数分片配置

- 来源A: [Training Arguments](https://github.com/NVIDIA/Megatron-LM/blob/main/megatron/training/arguments.py), v0.9+, 2024
  原文: "In standard PP+DP configurations without TP, parameters remain fully replicated."

- 来源B: [GitHub Issues](https://github.com/NVIDIA/Megatron-LM/issues), 2023
  原文: "Parameters are always replicated across DP ranks in the standard PP+DP setup. Optimizer states are what get sharded."

推论: tp>1 且启用参数拆分的配置需排除。需在 applicable_conditions 中加入 parameter_replication_across_dp == true。

### 综合判定
- 反例在默认配置下：不成立（不分片参数）
- 反例在特定配置下：部分成立（tp>1+参数拆分需排除）
- 约束调整：applicable_conditions 加入 parameter_replication_across_dp==true
- 误报风险：低

