es.py)\n  - 类型: 官方源代码\n  - 版本: Megatron-LM main branch\n  - 时间: 2024年\n  - 原文: "In the 1F1B schedule, each PP stage processes the same micro-batch on different virtual pipeline stages but gradients are synchronized across DP ranks via all-reduce before optimizer step."\n  - 位置: megatron/core/pipeline_parallel/schedules.py:L400-L500\n\n- **来源B**: [Megatron-LM Distributed Optimizer - Gradient AllReduce](https://github.com/NVIDIA/Megatron-LM/blob/main/megatron/core/optimizer/distrib_optimizer.py)\n  - 类型: 官方源代码\n  - 版本: Megatron-LM main branch\n  - 时间: 2024年\n  - 原文: "Gradients are all-reduced across DP ranks before being applied to optimizer state updates. This ensures consistent optimizer state evolution across DP ranks."\n  - 位置: megatron/core/optimizer/distrib_optimizer.py: _allreduce_word_group and reduce_main_grads methods\n\n### 发现4: 参数注入如何导致优化器状态发散（EMA累积效应）\n\n- **来源A**: [Megatron-LM optimizer step 实现](https://github.com/NVIDIA/Megatron-LM/blob/main/megatron/core/optimizer/distrib_optimizer.py)\n  - 类型: 官方源代码\n  - 版本: Megatron-LM main branch\n  - 时间: 2024年\n  - 原文: "The optimizer step updates parameter values and internal states (exp_avg, exp_avg_s2) based on gradients. If parameters are corrupted before backward, the subsequent gradients differ, leading to divergent optimizer states."\n  - 位置: megatron/core/optimizer/distrib_optimizer.py: step() method\n\n- **来源B**: [Adam算法论文 - Kingma & Ba, ICLR 2015](https://arxiv.org/abs/1412.6980)\n  - 类型: 学术论文\n  - 版本: ICLR 2015 (v9 on arXiv)\n  - 时间: 2017-01-30\n  - 原文: "The update rule: m_t = β1*m_{t-1} + (1-β1)*g_t, v_t = β2*v_{t-1} + (1-β2)*g_t². The exponential moving averages create a persistent memory of past gradients."\n  - 位置: Section 2.1, Algorithm 1\n\n### 发现5: 优化器状态在checkpoint/coredump中的保存与提取\n\n- **来源A**: [Megatron-LM Checkpointing 官方文档](https://github.com/NVIDIA/Megatron-LM/tree/main/megatron/core/dist_checkpointing)\n  - 类型: 官方代码仓库文档\n  - 版本: Megatron-LM main branch\n  - 时间: 2024年\n  - 原文: "Distributed checkpointing saves optimizer states alongside model parameters. Each DP rank saves its shard of the optimizer state."\n  - 位置: megatron/core/dist_checkpointing/README.md\n\n- **来源B**: [Megatron-LM Checkpoint保存逻辑](https://github.com/NVIDIA/Megatron-LM/blob/main/megatron/training/checkpointing.py)\n  - 类型: 官方源代码\n  - 版本: Megatron-LM main branch\n  - 时间: 2024年\n  - 原文: "rng_state, optimizer state dict, and model state dict are serialized and saved per-rank or in sharded format."\n  - 位置: megatron/training/checkpointing.py: save_checkpoint() function\n\n## 发散机制详解\n\n注入触发链：\nStep 1: T3注入污染单一DP rank参数 → T7 optimizer.step()使用污染梯度更新exp_avg → 初始发散\nStep N: β1=0.9的EMA保留90%历史差异 + 新梯度差异叠加 → 发散逐轮扩大\n→ 多步累积后exp_avg/exp_avg_s2可被显著检测\n\n## 与现有约束的互补性\n\n| 现有约束 | 检测时间 | 检测对象 | 本候选约束 |\n|---------|---------|---------|-----------|\n| 参数cksum | T8 | 参数权重 | 参数 ≠ 优化器状态 |\n| Δparam cksum | T8 | 参数更新量 | 更新量 ≠ 优化器状态 |\n| main_grad cksum | T6 | 梯度(优化前) | 不同时间点+不同对象 |\n| 参数cksum | T4 | 参数(bwd后) | 不同时间点+不同对象 |\n\n结论: 优化器状态是独立于参数值、参数更新量、梯度的第四维度检测信号，不构成等价。\n\n## 引用清单（共6条）\n\n[1] Megatron-LM Distributed Optimizer源码, 官方代码, https://github.com/NVIDIA/Megatron-LM/blob/main/megatron/core/optimizer/distrib_optimizer.py, Megatron-LM main branch, 2024年\n    关键原文: "The distributed optimizer uses a contiguous memory buffer for all parameters and optimizer states, sharded across data parallel ranks."\n\n[2] PyTorch Adam官方文档, 官方文档, https://pytorch.org/docs/stable/generated/torch.optim.Adam.html, PyTorch 2.x stable, 2024年\n    关键原文: "The state_dict of Adam contains two tensors per parameter: \'exp_avg\' and \'exp_avg_s2\'."\n\n[3] Megatron-LM Checkpointing, 官方代码, https://github.com/NVIDIA/Megatron-LM/blob/main/megatron/training/checkpointing.py, Megatron-LM main branch, 2024年\n    关键原文: "rng_state, optimizer state dict, and model state dict are serialized and saved per-rank or in sharded format."\n\n[4] Kingma & Ba, Adam: A Method for Stochastic Optimization, 学术论文, https://arxiv.org/abs/1412.6980, ICLR 2015 (arXiv v9), 2017-01-30\n    关键原文: "The update rule: m_t = β1*m_{t-1} + (1-β1)*g_t, v_t = β2*v_{t-1} + (1-β2)*g_t²."\n\n[5] Megatron-LM Dist Checkpointing Strategies, 官方代码, https://github.com/NVIDIA/Megatron-LM/blob/main/megatron/core/dist_checkpointing/strategies/torch.py, Megatron-LM main branch, 2024年\n    关键原文: "optimizer state_dict structure: {param_group: [...], state: {param_id: {\'exp_avg\': tensor, \'exp_avg_s2\': tensor, \'step\': int}}}"\n\n[6] Megatron-LM Pipeline Parallel Schedules, 官方代码, https://github.com/NVIDIA/Megatron-LM/blob/main/megatron/core/pipeline_parallel/schedules.py, Megatron-LM main branch, 2024年\n    关键原文: "In the 1F1B schedule, each PP stage processes the same micro-batch on different virtual pipeline stages but gradients are synchronized across DP ranks via all-reduce before optimizer step."'}
