## 核心发现

### 反例判定：部分成立

use_distributed_optimizer=True时，优化器状态(exp_avg/exp_avg_s2)跨DP rank分片存储，每个rank持有不同参数子集的状态。直接跨DP rank比较checksum不可行（分片不重叠）。约束需要添加限定条件 `use_distributed_optimizer=False`。

### 分片机制

DP Rank 0: [param_0..param_k] → exp_avg[0..k], exp_avg_s2[0..k]
DP Rank 1: [param_{k+1}..param_n] → exp_avg[k+1..n], exp_avg_s2[k+1..n]
→ 两个rank持有的状态完全没有重叠

### 约束修正建议

添加 `use_distributed_optimizer = False` 作为前提条件。注入测试时使用 `--no-use-distributed-optimizer` 确保每个DP rank持有完整参数和优化器状态副本。

### 关键引用

[1] Megatron-LM DistributedOptimizer 源码, https://github.com/NVIDIA/Megatron-LM/blob/main/megatron/core/optimizer/distrib_optimizer.py, main branch, 2024: "When use_distributed_optimizer=True, parameters and their optimizer states are sharded across data parallel ranks."
[2] Megatron-LM sharded_state_dict, 同上: "each DP rank only saves its local shard of the optimizer state."
[3] Megatron-LM ZeRO-1 doc, https://github.com/NVIDIA/Megatron-LM/tree/main/megatron/core/optimizer: "The distributed optimizer implements ZeRO Stage 1: optimizer state partitioning."
[4] Megatron-LM Parallel State, https://github.com/NVIDIA/Megatron-LM/blob/main/megatron/core/parallel_state.py: PP stages hold different parameters, comparison must be same-PP-stage across DP ranks.
