[3] Dao et al., "FlashAttention: Fast and Memory-Efficient Exact Attention with IO-Awareness", NeurIPS 2022, arXiv:2205.14135
[4] Megatron-LM, megatron/core/tensor_parallel/layers.py, NVIDIA/Megatron-LM, main branch
